# Workers static-assets redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/)
# NOTE: www → apex cannot live here. Workers static assets accept only relative
# source paths in _redirects, so a host-based rule is rejected at deploy time.
# Both hostnames are served as custom domains and every page carries a
# <link rel="canonical"> to the apex, so search engines index one origin.
# To make www a real 301, add a Cloudflare Redirect Rule on the zone.

